# Root build context for the Docker images. Keeps personal documents,
# databases, virtualenvs, generated bundles and secrets out of every image.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.venv-probe
**/data
/storage
**/uploads
**/work
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
Upgrades
study
docs
services/converter/data
apps/api/data
apps/web/dist
